<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-09-28 | Day 153: Subpoenas, 100-Minute AI Films, and $200/Minute Costs" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="OpenAI and Anthropic CEOs subpoenaed by Australia; first AI theatrical film "Sanxingdui" scheduled; AI short drama costs drop to $200/minute but producers lose more money; China-US establish AI dialogue mechanism. AI is transforming from a technical issue to an institutional issue." navActive="diary" lang="en">
